@startuml Level3_LinearSearch_Component
title Level 3 - Linear Search Component Diagram (Horizontal View)\nLinear Search Module - Component Process Flow
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam ArrowColor #0B5ED7
skinparam ArrowFontColor #0B5ED7
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #1E6FD9
  BorderColor #0B4FB0
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  RoundCorner 25
}

rectangle "Input Handler\n(Array and target)" as IH
rectangle "Array Traversal\nIterate through elements" as AT
rectangle "Element Comparator\nCompare with target" as EC
rectangle "Position Tracker\n(Match found)" as PT
rectangle "Result Handler\n(Return index ->\nSearch result)" as RH

IH --> AT : Array and\ntarget
AT --> EC : Pass current\nelement
EC --> PT : Match\nfound
PT --> RH : Return\nindex
EC .up.> AT : No match -> loop
RH .[dashed].> IH : Search result -> feedback to Input Handler

footer Linear Search: O(n) time complexity • Returns index if found, otherwise continues to next element
@enduml
